{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>電競《無畏契約》上海全球冠軍賽，戰隊「Loud」勝出。</p><p></p><p>總決賽由戰隊「Loud」迎戰「VIT」，上半場落後6分，不過「Loud」下半場反擊，連續追分，其中一位隊員拿到三殺，協助戰隊最終以13-11先下一城。</p><p></p><p>雖然第三場輸9-13，但之後兩場「Loud」連贏13-5及13-10，以總比數3-1封王，成為今屆冠軍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T15:00:40.998543+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T17:38:23.127418+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T14:58:44.603675+00:00","content_hash":"98fbfd3a780807390aba92d64fe21eeac7e1b982e23714a8965bc6d7c4c5c91d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}